# Control port only: this container never proxies client traffic. Every onion
# service is added at runtime over the control port (ADD_ONION) and published to
# the caddy container, which routes by Host header.
#
# Alpine's tor package creates the `tor` user and owns /var/lib/tor; a fresh named
# volume inherits that ownership, so drop privileges instead of fighting it.
User tor
SocksPort 0
ControlPort 0.0.0.0:9051
CookieAuthentication 1
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
Log notice stdout
SafeLogging 1

# If direct connections to relays are blocked on your network, route outbound
# traffic through a SOCKS5/HTTP proxy. A clash/mihomo "mixed" port works:
#Socks5Proxy 127.0.0.1:7890
